Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.85,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Che nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:35.81,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Fino a quando abbiamo scritto\Nquesto diario condiviso?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:36.16,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\fax0.2\fs20\fsp1.5\frz74.75\c&H606066&\pos(450,115)}Casa di nonna
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:40.12,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Aspettavo con impazienza\Nle risposte di mia sorella.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.54,Flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Come li hai disegnati bene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:48.05,Flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Disegniamo anche di oggi,\Nquando siamo arrivate al mare?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:50.35,Flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Che ne dici, Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.98,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Mitsuru sta sorridendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:54.40,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Quindi questo è…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:58.87,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Quindi questo è…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.39,Italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,un sogno.
