Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:14.44,EpTitle,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,432)\pos(162,310)}Motorcycle diaries 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.78,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Grazie mille.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.64,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Il prezzo delle sigarette\Nè salito ancora?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:32.84,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Sul serio, che fine sta facendo\Nil costo della vita? Datemi tregua.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.41,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Il numero 27, grazie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:38.72,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Subito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.47,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1400,0)\an4\b0\fax0.1\bord1\fs30\fnImpact\frz351.9\pos(224,37)\3c&H4E4E4E&\c&H552FF2&}Detective \Nassassino
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.47,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1400,0)\an4\b0\fax0.4\bord1\fs20\fnImpact\3c&H4E4E4E&\c&H361CE7&\frz355.3\pos(411,183)}Consigliato\N\h\h\h{\c&H21FF32&}dallo staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.47,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1400,0)\an4\b0\fscx70\fax0.1\bord1\fs40\fnImpact\3c&H4E4E4E&\c&H361CE7&\frz355.3\pos(295,199)}Estrazione\N{\c&H21FF32&}personaggio
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.56,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,E faccio anche un'estrazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.48,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Andiamo con questo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:46.60,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:53.02,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Che, scherziamo?!\NHo dimenticato il portafogli!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:57.70,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Il mio intero patrimonio
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:58.86,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,è tutto qui?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:02.95,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Quale scelgo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:06.28,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Mi scusi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:08.91,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Le piace davvero tanto\Nil Detective assassino, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.35,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Non particolarmente.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.75,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b0\fax0.1\bord1\fs30\fnImpact\frz351.9\3c&H4E4E4E&\c&H552FF2&\pos(119,50)}Detective \Nassassino
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.75,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b0\fax0.4\bord1\fs20\fnImpact\3c&H4E4E4E&\c&H361CE7&\frz355.3\pos(346,237)}Consigliato\N\h\h\h{\c&H21FF32&}dallo staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.75,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b0\fscx110\fscy130\fax0.1\bord1\fs40\fnImpact\3c&H4E4E4E&\c&H361CE7&\frz355.3\pos(151,234)}Estrazione\N{\c&H21FF32&}personaggio
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:15.34,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,È che ho trovato carino il POP.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:20.60,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ho proprio un debole\Nper le cose carine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.00,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Che faccio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:28.85,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Come non detto per le sigarette.\NPrendo solo qu—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:29.77,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.73,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Non glieli sto regalando,\Nè un prestito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:41.61,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sono stata io a disegnare il POP.\NQuindi è responsabilità mia, tipo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.24,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Allora, non faccio complimenti.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.70,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\bord0\fnVerdana\pos(269,139)\frx40\fry358\frz23.75\c&H000000&}Congratulazioni!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.70,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\b1\fscy280\frz20.94\bord0\fax0.4\c&H000000&\pos(401,136)}Premio
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.70,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\fs15\fax0.1\bord0\fnVerdana\c&H000000&\frz22.35\pos(361,268)}Scambialo con l'articolo\N\hall'entrata del negozio
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:48.70,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Il premio SS!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.70,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\b1\fnCourier New\fsp-1\fscx80\fs20\fs18)\frz25.87\move(118,56,127,61)\3c&H40F6FC&\c&H6E6E78&}Premio SS  Peluche
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:54.05,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Che carino! È troppo adorabile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:56.07,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Grazie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:57.58,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ecco…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:00.80,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\b1\fax0.3\bord0\fs13\fsp1\pos(370,207)\frz353.8\c&H121213&}Matsuki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.80,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Matsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:02.85,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Sono troppo felice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.36,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Allora…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.47,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Intanto, devo ripagarti\Ncome posso in questo momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.75,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ma ora non ha soldi, o sbaglio?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:15.91,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Infatti. In cambio…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:17.87,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Oplà.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:28.33,Main,Bambina 1,0,0,0,,Mi scusi! Lei fa sempre di testa sua!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.98,Main,Bambina 1,0,0,0,,Non puoi aprirlo\Nse non l'hai prima comprato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:35.84,Main,Bambina 1,0,0,0,,Mi dispiace davve…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:35.84,Main_Overlap,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Allora…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.96,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,questo ve lo compro io,\Ntanto ho il resto preciso.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:42.53,Main,Bambina 1,0,0,0,,Ecco…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.45,Main_Overlap,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Non preoccupatevi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:49.10,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,D'ora in poi cerca di tenerla\Npiù stretta possibile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:51.05,Main,Bambina 1,0,0,0,,Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.06,Main,Bambina 2,0,0,0,,Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:55.71,Main,Bambina 2,0,0,0,,Ehi, dai, tienila stretta!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.06,Main,Bambina 1,0,0,0,,Ma sentiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:00.00,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Quanti ricordi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.55,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Anch'io ero così, un tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.08,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Mia sorella
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:08.49,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,mi teneva la mano strettissima\Ncosì che non mi allontanassi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:17.31,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ah, grazie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.31,0:07:19.60,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Non me n'ero per niente accorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:24.36,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ascolta, Matsuki, non dovresti\Nprestare soldi così a cuor leggero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:30.35,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Non è detto che siano tutte\Nbrave persone come me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:38.44,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Che tipo strano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.27,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Adorabile, vero?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.74,Main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Che? Cosa sarebbe, questo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.24,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Non si tocca!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.38,Main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.87,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Buonasera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.31,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Questi 500 yen…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:16.09,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,prestameli finché\Nnon li finisco tutti.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:18.49,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Va bene, ma perché?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:20.19,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Per superstizione.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:22.61,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Il premio A?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:25.57,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\b1\fnCourier New\fsp-1\fscx80\fs20\fs18)\3c&HFAF8DB&\c&H6C7029&\frz39.52\move(93,64,98,67,0,1800)}Premio A  Peluche
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:26.36,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Congratulazioni.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.53,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Evviva! Che carino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:39.54,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\fscy80\b1\fs16\frz358.3\move(215,26,118,26)\3c&HD1E6EF&\c&HBBBBDD&}Festival dei dolci
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:46.81,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hai finito per oggi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:47.84,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:49.53,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Vuoi un passaggio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:53.22,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Come potrei mai salire\Nin moto con qualcuno
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.89,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,di cui non so nemmeno il nome?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:56.88,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Shiba Kirihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:00.88,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,La gente mi chiama Koshiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.36,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Koshiba, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.32,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Tu invece ti chiamavi\NMatsuki, giusto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.11,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ehi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:15.13,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Che tipo strano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:27.80,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\bord0\fnVerdana\pos(269,139)\frx40\fry358\frz23.75\c&H000000&}Congratulazioni!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:27.80,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\b1\fscy280\frz20.94\bord0\fax0.4\c&H000000&\pos(401,136)}Premio
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:27.80,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\fs15\fax0.1\bord0\fnVerdana\c&H000000&\frz22.35\pos(361,268)}Scambialo con l'articolo\N\hall'entrata del negozio
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:27.80,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Il premio D?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:37.60,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnCourier New\fsp-1\fscx90\fs20\fs18)\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H1A1A1B&\pos(95,65)\frz39.2\t(2811,2813,\bord0)\t(2813,3230,\blur2}Premio D  Peluche
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:31.13,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Congratulazioni.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:36.40,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Matsuki. Questo sarebbe carino?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.70,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ma sì, facciamo che è carino.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:41.83,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:45.86,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Mi chiamo Hikaru Matsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:49.36,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hikaru, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:59.37,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ma dai, ne hai uno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:02.26,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Parlo del posacenere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:03.87,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,È buon senso, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.41,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Senti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:12.76,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Tu che cosa fai, Koshiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:18.10,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Lavoro in un hotel.\NMi prendo cura dei nostri ospiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.68,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Non me l'aspettavo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:21.68,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,E perché?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.84,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Non immaginavo fossi uno stipendiato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:26.03,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Davvero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:28.27,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Insomma, vieni sempre qui,\Nche sia giorno o notte.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:33.66,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Beh, lavoro a turni.\NNe ho di diurni come di notturni.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.78,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Proprio come il konbini, quindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.79,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Sei sempre stata brava a disegnare?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:45.96,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,In passato boh, non saprei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:49.53,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Mia sorella, però,\Nmi faceva i complimenti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:51.93,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Quindi eri brava, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:55.18,Main,Capo konbini,0,0,0,,Matsuki! Vieni in cassa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:56.34,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Arrivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.68,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ci vediamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.00,Main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Senti un po',
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:14.36,Main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,l'altra volta c'era solo questo, giusto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.76,Main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Stanno aumentando\Ngiorno dopo giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:21.24,Main,Sara,0,0,0,,A quanto pare adori ancora\Nle cose carine, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:26.82,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Quindi te lo ricordavi?!\NSei fantastica, signorina Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.17,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ehi, Ikuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:33.04,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ti avevo detto che non si tocca!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:36.13,Main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Koshiba, dove li stai comprando?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:39.72,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Li sto prendendo\Ndal mio konbini preferito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:41.71,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ha un POP adorabile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:48.17,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Scusi un secondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.72,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:30.06,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscy80\frz17.73\move(228,31,253,31)\bord1\c&H5D5BC7&\3c&H404040&}Diario illustrato
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:30.06,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs17\frz18.15\move(313,309,335,309)\3c&HB6C0D8&\c&H343437&}Matsuki  Mit{\3c&H565C6E&\c&H1F1F20&}suru - Hikaru
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.64,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hotel Inhumans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.54,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Io vado.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:54.67,Main,Commessa,0,0,0,,Buonasera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.80,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.4\b1\fnComic Sans MS\bord1\fsp2\frz14.7\move(374,11,374,30)\fs30\t(\fs23)\c&H40F6FC&}Buonissimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.80,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnImpact\fs35\t(\fs28)\fax-0.2\frz8.922\move(378,155,378,147)\3c&H242425&\c&H5146DE&}Nikuman{\fscx50\fscy50}-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:06.85,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Che freddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:21.70,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Eh? Koshiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.29,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sei venuto di nuovo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.68,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Eppure hai preso tutti\Ngli articoli dell'estrazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:32.06,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Già. Proprio per quello
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.71,Main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,volevo restituirti\Ni soldi che mi hai prestato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.28,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Capisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.98,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Anche per me…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.34,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,è tutto finito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:45.97,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sono andata alla cremazione\Ndi mia sorella.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:49.34,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Insomma, sono vestita a lutto,\Ndev'essere difficile commentare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.51,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Perciò ho preferito spoilerartelo io.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.52,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sto bene, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:02.17,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sapevo che non le restava molto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.09,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ero pronta da un pezzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:08.15,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Però, tornata a casa\Ndopo la cremazione…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.79,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,ho avuto come una sensazione di vuoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.75,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Facevo spesso avanti e indietro\Ndall'ospedale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:20.26,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I cambi per quando era ricoverata,\Nle medicine per via orale…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:24.06,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ora che non devo fare più\Nnulla di tutto quello,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:26.80,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,mi sento persa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.11,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Così
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:32.52,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,ho pensato di fare altro part-time,\N giusto per muovermi un po'.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:35.06,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fscx90\fs10\b1\3c&HDF6D48&\frz359.9\pos(444,337)}Hai un nuovo messaggio
